    "detailed_description": "<strong>Daisy Dangerous</strong> is a short but captivating 2D puzzle and precision platformer that immerses players in a dark, treacherous world filled with intricate challenges, strongly based on the 1989 classic, Rick Dangerous. Players will guide Daisy through a series of perilous levels that require keen environmental awareness and precise movements to navigate successfully.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902320/extras/084fe1c399020f0be74eefb783d47495.poster.avif?t=1723028009\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902320/extras/084fe1c399020f0be74eefb783d47495.webm?t=1723028009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902320/extras/084fe1c399020f0be74eefb783d47495.mp4?t=1723028009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Players must deftly maneuver through platforms, avoiding deadly traps such as rolling boulders, spikes, and other hidden hazards that demand quick reflexes and careful planning. Daisy is equipped with a rifle and limited supplies of bombs and bullets. This scarcity forces players to conserve ammunition and utilize it only when absolutely necessary. Much of the gameplay involves using the environment to outsmart and defeat enemies. Players must lure adversaries into traps or use the terrain to their advantage to progress, adding a layer of strategic depth to the platforming challenges.  The game's limited resources and hazardous environments compel players to stay alert and adapt to each new challenge, making for a thrilling and immersive gaming experience.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902320/extras/16e51ace8e922fec1ddc89bde3f614ee.poster.avif?t=1723028009\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902320/extras/16e51ace8e922fec1ddc89bde3f614ee.webm?t=1723028009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902320/extras/16e51ace8e922fec1ddc89bde3f614ee.mp4?t=1723028009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Daisy Dangerous</strong> is a short but captivating 2D puzzle and precision platformer that immerses players in a dark, treacherous world filled with intricate challenges, strongly based on the 1989 classic, Rick Dangerous. Players will guide Daisy through a series of perilous levels that require keen environmental awareness and precise movements to navigate successfully.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902320/extras/084fe1c399020f0be74eefb783d47495.poster.avif?t=1723028009\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902320/extras/084fe1c399020f0be74eefb783d47495.webm?t=1723028009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902320/extras/084fe1c399020f0be74eefb783d47495.mp4?t=1723028009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Players must deftly maneuver through platforms, avoiding deadly traps such as rolling boulders, spikes, and other hidden hazards that demand quick reflexes and careful planning. Daisy is equipped with a rifle and limited supplies of bombs and bullets. This scarcity forces players to conserve ammunition and utilize it only when absolutely necessary. Much of the gameplay involves using the environment to outsmart and defeat enemies. Players must lure adversaries into traps or use the terrain to their advantage to progress, adding a layer of strategic depth to the platforming challenges.  The game's limited resources and hazardous environments compel players to stay alert and adapt to each new challenge, making for a thrilling and immersive gaming experience.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902320/extras/16e51ace8e922fec1ddc89bde3f614ee.poster.avif?t=1723028009\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902320/extras/16e51ace8e922fec1ddc89bde3f614ee.webm?t=1723028009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902320/extras/16e51ace8e922fec1ddc89bde3f614ee.mp4?t=1723028009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
